{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id29098726"}, "name":{"label":"Charmedgirl333"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-09-16T15:01:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.74.0"}, "id":{"label":"10375684403"}, "title":{"label":"Stylish hydration with mental health benefits!"}, "content":{"label":"Before I found this app, I was sceptical of water trackers. “I drink plenty of water,” I said! Turns out, not enough! \n\nThis app represents the single biggest turning point in my ongoing mental health struggles. Turns out, drinking lots of water helps depression. It’s not a cure-all, but it certainly helps. \n\nWater Llama combines science and design to make drinking water fun! I enjoy sipping my way through the day to unlock each new (beautiful) illustration.\n\nAnother useful feature are the gentle prompts throughout the day, including facts about the benefits of drinking water as the benefits of hydration on brain function (thought and memory processes and production of neurotransmitters). All these elements combine to form a thoughtful, lovely approach to continued hydration. \n\nPlease keep up your wonderful work and keep the new characters coming!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
